<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    100 BLN LIRE  COUPON     *8.25     MATURITY   *22.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  101.625   PAY DATE    22.MAY.97</p>
